er.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f19957e7d8e610c389b23fb294686a49.webm?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f19957e7d8e610c389b23fb294686a49.mp4?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you establish a strong defence, or attack the Calyx before it spreads too far? Dig in and build a massive force, or adopt a mobile and nimble strategy? There are many ways to defeat the different varieties of Calyx. Start your base wherever you like, experiment and develop your styles of play, and learn to cope with different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/e201b2ed103d9e76780348ab22f7df83.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/a03e53b81c948a7934d00f0b0f87ef95.poster.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/a03e53b81c948a7934d00f0b0f87ef95.webm?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/a03e53b81c948a7934d00f0b0f87ef95.mp4?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect Data Archives to gain Research Points, and use the tech tree to unlock and upgrade more advanced units and buildings. Unlock the Inferno flamethrower and watch the Calyx burn! Build the Unit Workshop and manufacture the Goliath, a massive, multi turret tank, and boost its speed with hover technology. Unlock Orbital technologies and fire a devastating laser beam from orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/8abca3a5e1881409ac290a337401bd3b.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/bc07b25088b9569d0716584523298dd3.poster.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/bc07b25088b9569d0716584523298dd3.webm?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/bc07b25088b9569d0716584523298dd3.mp4?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect and power communication arrays to access the corporation’s deep space network. Scan the Calyx roots to learn more about how these hostile lifeforms function. Discover new and dangerous Calyx variants as you battle to gain control of the planet and try to find a way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/ee2dc70387558f0f26d036978c92935d.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/1f98e62e3a738daa96ea352a309429df.poster.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/1f98e62e3a738daa96ea352a309429df.webm?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/1f98e62e3a738daa96ea352a309429df.mp4?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on the Early Access campaign:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial plus 16 maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech Tree </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Research Points and unlock new technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade units and buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 5 species of Calyx</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the evil Liquidator AI!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay with Skirmish mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the number of Calyx roots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose starting resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure available Ore fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your tech level and generate a layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the seed with friends so you can play the same challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/886cb4b48f5c1d3bb09818f42abca8d1.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1560 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/d20bba7ae3b03a43957d7256a6ab4bd9.avif?t=1783099513\" width=780 height=1224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/47348c8e1b7b1114f713bc7b016676df.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calyx is an Early Access release, and we’d love to hear your thoughts to help shape future development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please jump into the Discussion Forum, or join our Discord and let us know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f1d8b12d8ab3773cc843d5e0635dfc0d.poster.avif?t=1783099513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f1d8b12d8ab3773cc843d5e0635dfc0d.webm?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f1d8b12d8ab3773cc843d5e0635dfc0d.mp4?t=1783099513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A strategy game with a new kind of enemy, Calyx puts you in charge of a space mining outpost, locked in battle against powerful plant-aliens. Build your base, gather resources, assemble your forces, and take on the Calyx. With only an out-of-date AI for company, can you survive?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“Calyx Review - It's looking really good. It's a bit like Dune 2 and C&amp;C except you fight plants :)”<br>Worth A Buy<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/header.jpg?t=1783099513", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/d7e718faa7bdb9a170a0b841e166b7add9c509f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783099513", "capsule_imagev5": "https:/